      193,
      194,
      195
    ],
    "calibration": "Ucamco permits ignoring several deprecated image controls; rejection of non-default use is this project's explicit subset policy. AS has no computer-to-computer image effect. No guaranteed historical CAM displacement or previous whole-gate escape is claimed."
  },
